    "description": "Cross Century Pen and Pencil Set\nVintage Writing Instruments\n14K Gold Filled, With Original Presentation Box\nA classic Cross Century writing set featuring a ballpoint pen and matching mechanical pencil, both crafted with a 14K gold filled finish. The Century line is a cornerstone of American fine writing, renowned for its sleek, slim profile and iconic conical top. These instruments represent the height of 20th-century American manufacturing and remain highly sought after by professionals and collectors for their timeless design and reliable performance.\n14K gold filled construction featuring a polished pinstripe engine-turned texture\nSet includes one ballpoint pen and one matching mechanical pencil\nOriginal brown presentation box with a satin-lined interior and lifetime guarantee text\nEach instrument is engraved \"CROSS 14K GOLD FILLED MADE IN USA\" near the cap\nCondition:\nThe gold-filled finish shows minor surface scuffs and light micro-scratching consistent with age and gentle use. No significant dents, deep scratches, or brassing observed. The mechanical mechanisms are intact; however, the pen may require a fresh ink refill for optimal performance. The presentation box is in good structural condition with light shelf wear to the exterior fabric and minor fraying on the interior elastic holders.",
